    'clinic_prescriptions_badge' => 'Clinic',
    'clinic_prescriptions_title' => 'The owner\'s clinic prescriptions',
    'clinic_prescriptions_summary' => 'The owner writes prescriptions from company products and gives the medicines from a branch.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_purpose' => 'When the owner gives the medicines, stock leaves the chosen branch and the money is split into two funds.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_why' => 'The manufacturer\'s share and the clinic\'s share are written down for every prescription, so the totals stay clear.',
    'clinic_prescriptions_s1' => 'Open “Prescriptions” from the menu. The Super Admin login always has this page. An office account has it only after it is turned on for that account.',
