    'statement_matching_s4' => 'Read the result on each line: Match suggested, Same reference with a different amount, No pending claim, or Skipped.',
    'statement_matching_s5' => 'Press “Confirm match” if it is right, or “Turn down”. A line marked “Possibly fake” needs a note saying what you checked.',
    'statement_matching_s6' => 'Then approve the payment on Check order payments as usual.',
    'statement_matching_o1' => 'You can see which claims match the statement and which do not.',
    'statement_matching_t1' => 'The same file cannot be uploaded twice.',
    'statement_matching_w1' => 'The system never approves a payment. Confirming a match only records that you checked that line.',

